    <string name="privacy_text">Clima has no ads or analytics. For the forecast, the phone asks Open‑Meteo (free, no account) for the weather at your places\' coordinates, and sends what you type when searching a city; nothing else leaves. «My location» is optional and approximate, without Google services. Your places and forecasts are kept only on this phone, out of cloud backups. Only if you turn on MCP mode, the AI you connect with a token can check your places\' weather and, with a read-and-write token, add or remove them, through the relay.</string>
